      "spam": false,
      "value": "We've discussed this at length, for some time, internally. A recurring concern is that people may act out specifically to gain access to the troll hub.\n\nAnd if the troll hub becomes a desirable place to go, then it poses the problem of bifurcation of the central hub; in effect, pressuring people to go to a location where they may be harassed.",
      "viewerReactions": null
