      "spam": false,
      "value": "This would fundamentally not work. Its a similar argument to the  \"Should Overwatch have a toxic only competitive\" where people would be locked to if they were banned. This would create a room full of undesired people and people who are banned are generally ones all of us would not want to be a part of this community. As Dan Leslie stated, best thing to do if you want to make your own fun is to go into a private world and let out your desires there.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
