      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I personally would like a world that's like Box, but specifically for testing really loud, obnoxious effects. Like screen shake, red/blue stereo, microphone effects, (delving in to dark territory), flight, crashguns, invisibility, whatever. That way there's a safe place to test that stuff without worrying about ruining other people's experiences. And before someone says, MAKE YOUR OWN WORLD FILTHY HACKER. It's nice to have peers who share knowledge that I myself don't have, or try to use it in a more constructive mannyer (turn into a helicopter and fly people around)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
